      "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in me \nby the Constitution and statutes and as \nPresident of the* United States, it is \nordered that section 3 of Executive Order \nNo. 10479 of August 13, 1953, entitled \n“ Establishing the Government Contract \nCommittee” as amended by Executive \nOrder No. 10482 of August 15,1953, shall \nbe, and it is hereby, amended (1) by \nstriking from the preamble of the said \nsection the word “fifteen” and inserting \nin lieu thereof the word “sixteen”, and"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 7158,
      "char_start": 6816,
